BT 59.53 302.24 Td (4 Password rules) Tj ET
BT /F1 11.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 277.33 Td (4.1 Minimum length) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.50 Tf ET
BT 59.53 259.41 Td (Passwords must be at least 15 characters long. A passphrase made of several unrelated words is an) Tj ET
BT 59.53 244.53 Td (easy way to meet this rule and is encouraged.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 216.39 Td (4.2 Long passwords) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.50 Tf ET
BT 59.53 198.46 Td (Systems must accept passwords of at least 64 characters. Systems must not cut a password short) Tj ET
BT 59.53 183.58 Td (without telling the user, and must accept spaces and printable characters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 155.44 Td (4.3 Composition and blocklist) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.50 Tf ET
BT 59.53 137.52 Td (Halvenroot does not impose composition rules \(such as requiring a mix of character types\). New) Tj ET
BT 59.53 122.64 Td (passwords are checked against a blocklist of common and breached passwords. A password that) Tj ET
BT 59.53 107.76 Td (appears on the blocklist is rejected, and the identity portal asks the user to choose another one.) Tj ET

