BT 59.53 670.64 Td (4.5 Compromised passwords) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.50 Tf ET
BT 59.53 652.72 Td (If you know or suspect that a password has been compromised, change it immediately and report it to) Tj ET
BT 59.53 637.83 Td (the Security Operations Centre within 1 hour. Report it even if you have already changed the) Tj ET
BT 59.53 622.95 Td (password, and even if you are not sure. The Security Operations Centre handles the report under the) Tj ET
BT 59.53 608.07 Td (Account-Compromise Incident Runbook.) Tj ET
